/* rebuilt by andy-harness reverse-engineering pipeline
 * template: installer_wizard -- dialog-driven installer rebuilt from the sample
 * generated by rebuild_gui_exe.py -- do not edit by hand
 * build  : tcc.exe -o out.exe rebuilt.c -luser32 -lgdi32 -lkernel32
 * source : run $run_id ($subject_name)
 *
 * UI: DLG_TEMPLATE holds the raw bytes of the sample's RT_DIALOG resource
 *     (title / controls / ids / geometry all come from the target itself) and
 *     is created directly via CreateDialogIndirectParam -- no unit conversion.
 * Behavior: Install pulls the embedded payload out of this exe's own overlay,
 *     invokes the external extractor to really unpack it into the chosen folder
 *     and drives the progress bar from the extractor output; when the extractor
 *     is missing it degrades to "release the payload file only" and says so.
 */
